---
/**
 * Tap-to-call poison hotlines for chocolate / toxin pages.
 * Numbers verified against ASPCA APCC and Pet Poison Helpline public pages.
 */
---

<div class="emergency-hotlines" role="group" aria-label="Pet poison hotlines">
  <a href="tel:+18884264435" data-tel-hotline="aspca">
    ASPCA APCC · (888) 426-4435
  </a>
  <a href="tel:+18557647661" data-tel-hotline="pph">
    Pet Poison Helpline · (855) 764-7661
  </a>
</div>
<p class="emergency-hotline-note">
  Consultation fees may apply. Call a veterinarian or emergency clinic if your pet is in distress.
  Have weight, product type, amount, and time of ingestion ready.
</p>

<style>
  .emergency-hotline-note {
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }
</style>
